Scoped threshold video filter

The option table, pix_fmts list, four-pad layout, size check, framesync input
settings (sync=1, before=EXT_STOP, after=EXT_STOP on all four inputs), eight-bit
selection, plane mask and plane copy semantics in src/video-ops/threshold.ts
follow libavfilter/vf_threshold.c (threshold_options, pix_fmts, filter_slice,
process_frame, config_input, config_output, inputs) and
libavfilter/vf_threshold_init.h (threshold8, ff_threshold_init).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
